flowchart TD
    User([Pet owner])

    subgraph UI["User interface: app.py (Streamlit)"]
        Forms["Forms: owner, add pet, add task<br/>(validates HH:MM start time)"]
        Session[("st.session_state<br/>keeps the Owner between reruns")]
        Views["Views: conflict warnings, filtered task table,<br/>Complete task button, Build Schedule + Why this plan?"]
    end

    subgraph Logic["Logic layer: pawpal_system.py"]
        Owner["Owner<br/>name, minutes per day, pets"]
        Pet["Pet<br/>name, species, age, tasks"]
        Task["Task<br/>title, duration, priority, frequency,<br/>start_time, due_date, completed"]
        Scheduler["Scheduler<br/>generate_daily_plan, sort_by_time,<br/>filter_tasks, detect_conflicts, explain_plan"]
    end

    CLI["main.py<br/>terminal demo"]
    Tests["tests/test_pawpal.py<br/>pytest checks"]

    User -->|enters data, clicks buttons| Forms
    Forms -->|add_pet, add_task| Owner
    Session <-->|stores and reuses| Owner
    Owner -->|has many| Pet
    Pet -->|needs many| Task
    Scheduler -->|plans for| Owner
    Scheduler -->|reads pending tasks via get_all_tasks| Task
    Views -->|builds Scheduler, calls methods| Scheduler
    Views -->|complete_task adds next occurrence| Pet
    Scheduler -->|plan, skipped, conflict messages, explanation| Views
    Views -->|shows results| User

    CLI -.->|uses| Logic
    Tests -.->|verifies| Logic
